{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:21 2026-11-11 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:21 2026-11-11 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:21 2026-11-11 HKT</p><img alt=\"「包裝福星」呂健威11月贏足\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl_square/ac1fd53942d917faeed8a69b1fe7f88d/2026-11/r9_2.jpg\"/><p>今晚練馬師王冠軍，需要在尾場決勝負，結果卻由沒有競爭力的練馬師贏馬，呂健威馬房的「包裝福星」在班德禮胯下爆岀十倍冷門勝岀，廖廄的「一生好彩」後上跑第二，令一直領先的巫偉傑以二十八分成為練馬師王冠軍。十一月份四次賽事跑過，呂健威次次賽事有馬贏，月內已經六捷。<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T15:51:20.392625+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T15:21:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T00:19:52.611971+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T15:44:49.226862+00:00","content_hash":"d58737acd2666d7e217ad4fde6c4d674d30b06828de30d75144c885346c5e971","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}